---
import InfoPage from '../layouts/InfoPage.astro';
import { getBranches } from '../lib/site-data';
const launched = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_LAUNCH === 'true';
const ALLERGENS = ['Celery', 'Cereals containing gluten', 'Crustaceans', 'Eggs', 'Fish', 'Lupin', 'Milk', 'Molluscs', 'Mustard', 'Tree nuts', 'Peanuts', 'Sesame', 'Soya', 'Sulphites'];
const MARKS = [['V', 'Vegetarian'], ['VG', 'Vegan'], ['GF', 'Gluten free'], ['DF', 'Dairy free'], ['H', 'Halal']];
const open = (await getBranches()).filter((b) => b.status === 'open');
---
<InfoPage
  title="Allergens and dietary needs"
  description="How to eat safely at Fatt Pundit: the 14 major allergens, our menu marks, and who to ask."
  kicker="Before you order"
  heading="Allergens and dietary needs"
  updated="23 November 2026"
  summary={[
    'Tell your server about any allergy or intolerance before you order, every visit.',
    'Every menu marks V, VG, GF, DF and H, and there are full vegan, gluten-free, dairy-free and halal menus.',
    "Our kitchens share woks, fryers and steamers, so we can't promise a dish is free of traces.",
  ]}
  questions={{ related: open.map((b) => ({ href: `/${b.id}/menu/`, label: `${b.shortName} menus` })) }}
>
  <p>Recipes and suppliers change, so the team checks each dish with the kitchen for you. Mention any allergy or intolerance <strong>before you order</strong>, on every visit.</p>
  <h2>The 14 major allergens</h2>
  <p>Our team can tell you which of these are in every dish.</p>
  <ul class="allergen-grid" role="list">
    {ALLERGENS.map((a) => <li>{a}</li>)}
  </ul>
  <h2>Marks on our menus</h2>
  <dl class="marks">
    {MARKS.map(([k, v]) => <div><dt>{k}</dt><dd>{v}</dd></div>)}
  </dl>
  <p>On each menu page, "Show only" keeps just the dishes with the marks you choose.</p>
  <p>Our kitchens are busy and share woks, fryers and steamers, so we can't promise any dish is completely free of traces of an allergen.</p>
  {!launched && <p class="todo">Draft wording, to be confirmed by Fatt Pundit's kitchen team before launch.</p>}
</InfoPage>

<style>
  /* Two columns of plain list items (no markers: each is one allergen on its own line). */
  .allergen-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-5); margin: 0 0 var(--space-5); padding: 0; list-style: none; max-width: 36rem; }
  .allergen-grid li { padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--fp-fg-muted); }
  /* Menu marks: same chip look as the menu's diet filters. */
  .marks { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-2); margin: 0 0 var(--space-5); padding: 0; }
  .marks div { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); min-height: var(--target-min, 44px); padding: 0 var(--space-4); border: var(--border-control, 2px) solid var(--fp-control, currentColor); background: var(--fp-field-bg, transparent); }
  .marks dt { font-weight: 700; }
  .marks dd { margin: 0; }
</style>
